  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "09f575c2-2a8e-4214-97cf-340c3287c7e8"],
 "} -> {",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["slots", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "017b7854-164a-4211-a239-d8800ea0d639"],
 "} raises or lowers indices with the metric. Nothing is computed if the \
Chain is unset.\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"6fad6298-a86c-4f35-9244-650bd8396305"],
 "Options are Chain, which overrides and stores the recipe, Using, which \
chooses the metric of each bundle, and Apply, which defaults to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["$Apply"]], "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/$Apply", 
    "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
