 ".\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"53c2bb2b-94ed-442d-a61c-57d8b5a7f5f3"],
 "Compute checks the Chain's slot specification against the object, reports \
an Apply key that is neither ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["Map"]], "paclet:ref/Map"},
   "RefLink",
   BaseStyle->{"InlineFormula"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
